  "description": "Theme-aware SVG charts for Blazor: line, area, bar, pie, donut, sparkline, Sankey and more. Every chart computes its geometry with a D3 module bundled in the package, so there is nothing to install from npm; the charts need JavaScript and show a same-size placeholder under static server rendering. Colors follow the active daisyUI v5 theme via CSS custom properties (--color-primary, etc.).",
